<TXSPN>There's no way to explain it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no way I could explain it.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき血.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "200" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Stop <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why would I need to do that?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's no point panicking over something that happens in a dream.<PG>
Maybe this is real?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A reality where <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> stabs <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> with a knife over and over can't exist.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n90\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
