<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n90\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n0\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Honestly, it's just that my body won't move.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It isn't as simple as being horrified, or being scared.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I don't deny what's happening in front of me―
{PAUSE ""}
my sense of self will surely collapse.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But... there's one thing I've figured out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There's a hint that this might be the <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="あれ">curse-killing</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物2\r\n4\r\n200\r\n100\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
