{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The cursed eyes <STYLE ID="4">Chiga-nee</STYLE> talked about.<PG>
Hey... why <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Ha... 
{PAUSE ""}
Hahaha... 
{PAUSE ""}
Hahaha...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What a strange dream...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A dream―
{PAUSE ""}
A dream―
{PAUSE ""}
A dream―
{PAUSE ""}
Hey―
{PAUSE ""}
Tell me it's a dream!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
