{MESON "500"}
The last thing I heard of <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE> voice was―
{PAUSE ""}
a perfectly ordinary―
{PAUSE ""}
death scream.<PG>
Stabbing <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> over and over, <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was―
{PAUSE ""}
smiling happily.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Seeing that smile, I... 
{PAUSE ""}
smiled along with her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> moved away from <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> and smiled at me... 
{PAUSE ""}
I smiled too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because... 
{PAUSE ""}
all I can do is laugh.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Haha... 
{PAUSE ""}
Hahaha...!
